      "description": "The tool allows one to generate point, line or polygon shapes from a table with the following attribute fields:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- identifier&lt;br/&gt;- x coordinate&lt;br/&gt;- y coordinate&lt;br/&gt;- optional: z coordinate (this will create a 3D shapefile)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The table must be sorted in vertex order.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The identifier has different meanings:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;* Point Shapes: The identifier is arbitrary&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;* Line Shapes: The identifier is unique for each line&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;* Polygon Shapes: The identifier is unique for each polygon; the first polygon vertex may but must not be duplicated in order to close the polygon&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;",
