      "description": "Other Common Names: Laplacian, Laplacian of Gaussian, LoG, Marr Filter&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Standard kernel 1 (3x3):&lt;br/&gt; 0 | -1 |  0&lt;br/&gt;-- + -- + --&lt;br/&gt;-1 |  4 | -1&lt;br/&gt;-- + -- + --&lt;br/&gt; 0 | -1 |  0&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Standard kernel 2 (3x3):&lt;br/&gt;-1 | -1 | -1&lt;br/&gt;-- + -- + --&lt;br/&gt;-1 |  8 | -1&lt;br/&gt;-- + -- + --&lt;br/&gt;-1 | -1 | -1&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Standard kernel 3 (3x3):&lt;br/&gt;-1 | -2 | -1&lt;br/&gt;-- + -- + --&lt;br/&gt;-2 | 12 | -2&lt;br/&gt;-- + -- + --&lt;br/&gt;-1 | -2 | -1&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;",
